IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sg-core`
IMPORT `sg-periods`

-- Companies Act 1967 (Singapore), 2020 Revised Edition: Part 5 Division 5 -- the annual return (s 197) and the financial year of a company (s 198).
-- Layer 1: the law, objectively. Part sgm. Text: the SSO informal consolidation as the file renders it (a rendering, not the official text).
--
-- The keel asks this module two facts (PLAN.md section 4, table A): s 4(1) "annual return" (the return required to be lodged under section 197(1))
-- and s 4(1) "financial year" (a financial year of the company as section 198 determines). They are answered at the end of each section.
-- Every time limit is counted by the `period:` functions of the keel; the "after the annual general meeting" test is a comparison of two days.
-- READING A RESULT: JUST TRUE is yes; JUST FALSE is the text's no in its own words; NOTHING is "the text does not say".

§ `Section 197(1) and (1A): when the return must be lodged`

-- (1)(a) and (b), (1A)(a) and (b): the number of months after the end of the financial year.
-- src:17667 | (a) in the case of a listed company — within 5 months after the
-- src:17668 | end of its financial year; and
@ref s 197(1)(a) (src:17667-17668)
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 197(1)(a) the months after the end of the financial year within which a listed company must lodge its return` MEANS 5

-- src:17670 | (b) in any other case — within 7 months after the end of its
-- src:17671 | financial year.
@ref s 197(1)(b) (src:17670-17671)
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 197(1)(b) the months after the end of the financial year within which any other company must lodge its return` MEANS 7

-- src:17679 | (a) in the case of a listed company — within 6 months after the
-- src:17680 | end of its financial year; and
@ref s 197(1A)(a) (src:17679-17680)
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 197(1A)(a) the months after the end of the financial year within which a listed company must lodge its return` MEANS 6

-- src:17682 | (b) in any other case — within 8 months after the end of its
-- src:17683 | financial year.
@ref s 197(1A)(b) (src:17682-17683)
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 197(1A)(b) the months after the end of the financial year within which any other company must lodge its return` MEANS 8

-- src:17675 | (1A) A company having a share capital and keeping a branch
-- src:17676 | register in any place outside Singapore must lodge a return with the
-- src:17677 | Registrar after its annual general meeting —
@ref s 197(1A) (src:17675-17677)
GIVEN `the company has a share capital` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the company keeps a branch register in a place outside Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 197(1A) the company is one mentioned in subsection (1A)` MEANS
    `the company has a share capital` AND `the company keeps a branch register in a place outside Singapore`

-- src:17661 | Annual return by companies
-- src:17663 | 197.—(1) Every company, other than a company mentioned in
-- src:17664 | subsection (1A), must lodge a return with the Registrar after its
-- src:17665 | annual general meeting —
-- src:17667 | (a) in the case of a listed company — within 5 months after the
-- src:17668 | end of its financial year; and
-- src:17670 | (b) in any other case — within 7 months after the end of its
-- src:17671 | financial year.
-- src:17675 | (1A) A company having a share capital and keeping a branch
-- src:17676 | register in any place outside Singapore must lodge a return with the
-- src:17677 | Registrar after its annual general meeting —
-- src:17679 | (a) in the case of a listed company — within 6 months after the
-- src:17680 | end of its financial year; and
-- src:17682 | (b) in any other case — within 8 months after the end of its
-- src:17683 | financial year.
@ref s 197(1) (src:17661-17683)
GIVEN `the company is a listed company` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the company has a share capital` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the company keeps a branch register in a place outside Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 197(1) the number of months after the end of the financial year within which the company must lodge its return` MEANS
    IF `s 197(1A) the company is one mentioned in subsection (1A)` `the company has a share capital` `the company keeps a branch register in a place outside Singapore`
    THEN (IF `the company is a listed company` THEN `s 197(1A)(a) the months after the end of the financial year within which a listed company must lodge its return` ELSE `s 197(1A)(b) the months after the end of the financial year within which any other company must lodge its return`)
    ELSE (IF `the company is a listed company` THEN `s 197(1)(a) the months after the end of the financial year within which a listed company must lodge its return` ELSE `s 197(1)(b) the months after the end of the financial year within which any other company must lodge its return`)

-- The last day: the end of the financial year plus the months (P1, P4: 31 August plus 6 months is 28 February), plus any days the Registrar has added under subsection (1B).
-- src:17661 | Annual return by companies
