-- src:17664 | subsection (1A), must lodge a return with the Registrar after its
-- src:17665 | annual general meeting —
-- src:17667 | (a) in the case of a listed company — within 5 months after the
-- src:17668 | end of its financial year; and
-- src:17670 | (b) in any other case — within 7 months after the end of its
-- src:17671 | financial year.
-- src:17675 | (1A) A company having a share capital and keeping a branch
-- src:17676 | register in any place outside Singapore must lodge a return with the
