    ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "each of the company's subsequent financial years starts immediately after the end of the previous financial year and ends on the last day of a period of 12 months (or such other regular interval as the Registrar may allow)" (the words of subsection (1)(b), repeated; fork F-D1)

§ `Section 198(4) to (6): changing the last day of the financial year by notice`

-- (5): the Registrar's approval must be obtained if the notice (a) results in a financial year longer than 18 months; or (b) is lodged less than 5 years after the end of an
-- earlier financial year that ended on or after 31 August 2018, if the end of that earlier financial year was changed under this section.
-- src:17800 | (5) The Registrar’s approval must be obtained if the notice
-- src:17801 | mentioned in subsection (4) —
-- src:17803 | (a) results in a financial year being longer than 18 months; or
-- src:17805 | (b) is lodged less than 5 years after the end of an earlier
-- src:17806 | financial year that ended on a date on or after 31 August
-- src:17807 | 2018, if the end of that earlier financial year was changed
-- src:17808 | under this section.
@ref s 198(5) (src:17800-17808)
GIVEN `the day on which the notice is lodged` IS A DATE
      `the last day of the earlier financial year` IS A DATE
      `the end of that earlier financial year was changed under section 198` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 198(5) the notice is lodged less than 5 years after the end of an earlier financial year` MEANS
        `the end of that earlier financial year was changed under section 198`
    AND `the last day of the earlier financial year` AT LEAST `s 198 the day 31 August 2018`
    AND `the day on which the notice is lodged` GREATER THAN `the last day of the earlier financial year`
    AND `the day on which the notice is lodged` LESS THAN `period: the last day of a period after` `the last day of the earlier financial year` 5 Years

-- src:17800 | (5) The Registrar’s approval must be obtained if the notice
-- src:17801 | mentioned in subsection (4) —
-- src:17803 | (a) results in a financial year being longer than 18 months; or
-- src:17805 | (b) is lodged less than 5 years after the end of an earlier
-- src:17806 | financial year that ended on a date on or after 31 August
-- src:17807 | 2018, if the end of that earlier financial year was changed
-- src:17808 | under this section.
@ref s 198(5) (src:17800-17808)
GIVEN `the notice results in a financial year being longer than 18 months` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the day on which the notice is lodged` IS A DATE
      `the last day of the earlier financial year` IS A DATE
      `the end of that earlier financial year was changed under section 198` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 198(5) the Registrar's approval must be obtained for the notice` MEANS
    IF `the notice results in a financial year being longer than 18 months` OR `s 198(5) the notice is lodged less than 5 years after the end of an earlier financial year` `the day on which the notice is lodged` `the last day of the earlier financial year` `the end of that earlier financial year was changed under section 198`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The Registrar's approval must be obtained if the notice (a) results in a financial year being longer than 18 months; or (b) is lodged less than 5 years after the end of an earlier financial year" (the "if" gate of a duty; fork F-W1)

-- (6): the notice cannot specify a new date after the expiry of any of three periods.
-- src:17812 | (6) The notice under subsection (4) cannot specify a new date as the
-- src:17813 | last day of the company’s financial year —
-- src:17815 | (a) after the expiry of the period under section 175 within
-- src:17816 | which an annual general meeting of the company must be
-- src:17817 | held after that financial year;
-- src:17819 | (b) after the expiry of the period under section 197 within
-- src:17820 | which an annual return of the company must be lodged
-- src:17821 | with the Registrar after that financial year; or
-- src:17823 | (c) after the expiry of the period under section 203 within
-- src:17824 | which a copy of the financial statements, or consolidated
-- src:17825 | financial statements, balance sheet, and documents
-- src:17826 | mentioned in section 203(1) are required to be sent to all
-- src:17827 | persons entitled to receive notice of general meetings of the
-- src:17828 | company.
@ref s 198(6) (src:17812-17828)
GIVEN `the notice is lodged after the expiry of the period under section 175 within which an annual general meeting of the company must be held after that financial year` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the notice is lodged after the expiry of the period under section 197 within which an annual return of the company must be lodged with the Registrar after that financial year` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the notice is lodged after the expiry of the period under section 203 within which a copy of the financial statements and the documents mentioned in section 203(1) are required to be sent to all persons entitled to receive notice of general meetings of the company` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 198(6) the notice cannot specify the new date as the last day of the financial year` MEANS
    IF     `the notice is lodged after the expiry of the period under section 175 within which an annual general meeting of the company must be held after that financial year`
        OR `the notice is lodged after the expiry of the period under section 197 within which an annual return of the company must be lodged with the Registrar after that financial year`
        OR `the notice is lodged after the expiry of the period under section 203 within which a copy of the financial statements and the documents mentioned in section 203(1) are required to be sent to all persons entitled to receive notice of general meetings of the company`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "The notice under subsection (4) cannot specify a new date as the last day of the company's financial year (a) after the expiry of ...; (b) after the expiry of ...; or (c) after the expiry of ..." (a prohibition limited by its own wording; none of the three limbs is met; fork F-B2 reading)

-- (4): "a company may by notice lodged with the Registrar in the prescribed form specify a new date as the last day of the company's financial year ... subject to subsections (5) and (6)".
-- A grant gated by "by notice lodged": NOTHING when a gate fails (grant ruling of 2026-11-12, limit 1; fork F-G1). The approval and the bar are taken as the facts the functions above answer.
-- src:17790 | (4) Despite subsections (1) and (3), but subject to subsections (5)
-- src:17791 | and (6), a company may by notice lodged with the Registrar in the
-- src:17792 | prescribed form specify a new date as the last day of the company’s
-- src:17793 | financial year to apply to its previous or current financial year.
@ref s 198(4) (src:17790-17793)
GIVEN `the notice is lodged with the Registrar in the prescribed form` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the Registrar's approval must be obtained for the notice` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the Registrar has approved the notice` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the notice cannot specify the new date under subsection (6)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 198(4) the company may by notice specify a new date as the last day of its financial year` MEANS
    IF     `the notice is lodged with the Registrar in the prescribed form`
       AND (NOT `the notice cannot specify the new date under subsection (6)`)
       AND ((NOT `the Registrar's approval must be obtained for the notice`) OR `the Registrar has approved the notice`)
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "a company may by notice lodged with the Registrar in the prescribed form specify a new date ..., subject to subsections (5) and (6)" (a power whose gates are not all met; the grant ruling, limit 1; fork F-G1)

§ `Section 198: the seam the keel asks (s 4(1) "financial year")`

-- The keel asks: is this period a financial year of the company as section 198 determines? It is, if it is the first financial year of a company incorporated
-- on or after 31 August 2018, a subsequent one of such a company, the first financial year of an older company ending on or after that date, or a subsequent one of an older company.
-- src:17739 | 198.—(1) Where a company is incorporated on or after 31 August
-- src:17740 | 2018 —
-- src:17742 | (a) the company’s first financial year starts on the company’s
-- src:17743 | date of incorporation and, subject to subsection (4), ends
-- src:17748 | on the last day of the company’s first financial year as
-- src:17749 | furnished under section 19(1)(b); and
-- src:17751 | (b) each of the company’s subsequent financial years starts
-- src:17752 | immediately after the end of the previous financial year
-- src:17753 | and ends on the last day of a period of 12 months (or such
-- src:17754 | other regular interval as the Registrar may allow).
-- src:17764 | (3) Where a company was incorporated before 31 August 2018 —
-- src:17766 | (a) the last day of the financial year for the company’s first
-- src:17767 | financial year ending on or after 31 August 2018 is —
-- src:17769 | (i) where the company had, before 31 August 2018,
-- src:17770 | lodged an annual return, or lodged a notification with
-- src:17771 | the Registrar informing the Registrar of the end of
-- src:17772 | the company’s financial year — the anniversary of
-- src:17773 | the last day of the financial year as indicated by the
-- src:17774 | company in the last annual return or last such
-- src:17775 | notification with the Registrar; or
-- src:17777 | (ii) where the company had not, before 31 August 2018,
-- src:17778 | lodged an annual return, or lodged a notification with
-- src:17779 | the Registrar informing the Registrar of the end of
-- src:17780 | the company’s financial year — the anniversary of
-- src:17781 | the date of incorporation of the company; and
-- src:17783 | (b) each of the company’s subsequent financial years starts
-- src:17784 | immediately after the end of the previous financial year
-- src:17785 | and ends on the last day of a period of 12 months (or such
-- src:17786 | other regular interval as the Registrar may allow).
@ref s 198 (src:17739-17786)
GIVEN `the date of incorporation of the company` IS A DATE
      `the first day of the period` IS A DATE
      `the last day of the period` IS A DATE
      `the last day of the first financial year as furnished under section 19(1)(b)` IS A DATE
      `a notice under section 198(4) has specified a new last day for the first financial year` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the new last day specified by that notice` IS A DATE
      `the company had, before 31 August 2018, lodged an annual return, or lodged a notification informing the Registrar of the end of its financial year` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the last day of the financial year as indicated in the last annual return or last such notification` IS A DATE
      `the last day of the previous financial year` IS A DATE
      `the number of months in the regular interval (12, or the other interval the Registrar allows)` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 198 the period is a financial year of the company as section 198 determines` MEANS
    IF `s 198(1) the company is incorporated on or after 31 August 2018` `the date of incorporation of the company` EQUALS JUST TRUE
    THEN (IF     `s 198(1)(a) the period is the first financial year of the company` `the date of incorporation of the company` `the first day of the period` `the last day of the period` `the last day of the first financial year as furnished under section 19(1)(b)` `a notice under section 198(4) has specified a new last day for the first financial year` `the new last day specified by that notice` EQUALS JUST TRUE
              OR `s 198(1)(b) the period is a subsequent financial year of the company` `the last day of the previous financial year` `the first day of the period` `the last day of the period` `the number of months in the regular interval (12, or the other interval the Registrar allows)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
          THEN JUST TRUE
          ELSE JUST FALSE)   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): s 4(1) "“financial year” ... in relation to a company — is also to be determined in accordance with section 198" and section 198(1)(a) and (b) say which periods they are
    ELSE (IF     `s 198(3)(a) the period is the company's first financial year ending on or after 31 August 2018` `the company had, before 31 August 2018, lodged an annual return, or lodged a notification informing the Registrar of the end of its financial year` `the last day of the financial year as indicated in the last annual return or last such notification` `the date of incorporation of the company` `the last day of the period` EQUALS JUST TRUE
              OR `s 198(3)(b) the period is a subsequent financial year of the company` `the last day of the previous financial year` `the first day of the period` `the last day of the period` `the number of months in the regular interval (12, or the other interval the Registrar allows)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
          THEN JUST TRUE
          ELSE JUST FALSE)   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): s 4(1) "“financial year” ... in relation to a company — is also to be determined in accordance with section 198" and section 198(3)(a) and (b) say which periods they are
